| Proof of vaccination with quadrivalent ACYW-135 is required for travellers departing Lebanon and going to Hajj, Umrah, and to certain African countries.<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://www.iamat.org/country/lebanon/risk/meningococcal-meningitis |title=Lebanon Required Vaccinations: Meningococcal Meningitis |work=iamat.org |publisher=International Association for Medical Assistance to Travellers (IAMAT) |date=20 August 2020 |access-date=2 December 2020 |archive-date=26 October 2020 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201026011804/https://www.iamat.org/country/lebanon/risk/meningococcal-meningitis |url-status=dead }}</ref>
